/*⁣‍‌‌⁠‍‍⁠​​‌⁠​‌​​⁠⁠⁠‍‍⁠​​⁠⁠⁠​‍‌‌⁠⁠‍‌‌​‍⁠⁠​⁠‌⁠​‍⁠‌⁠‌‌​‍​‌‌‍‌⁠​‌‍‍‌​⁣ ==========================================
   BLACK & WHITE — 韩系 INS 群聊主题
   ========================================== */

:root {
  /* ===== 基础黑白色 ===== */
  --bw-black: #252525;
  --bw-dark: #383838;
  --bw-gray: #888888;
  --bw-light-gray: #E9E9E9;
  --bw-border: #E6E6E6;
  --bw-white: #FFFFFF;
  --bw-bg: #F5F5F5;

  /* ===== 我方气泡 ===== */
  --bubble-me-bg: #292A2C;
  --bubble-me-color: #FFFFFF;
  --bubble-me-radius: 0px;
  --bubble-me-shadow: none;

  /* ===== 对方气泡 ===== */
  --bubble-them-bg: #FFFFFF;
  --bubble-them-color: #292A2C;
  --bubble-them-border: none;
  --bubble-them-radius: 0px;
  --bubble-them-shadow: none;

  /* ===== 群成员名字 ===== */
  --grp-sender-name-color: #929292;
  --grp-sender-name-size: 11px;
  --grp-sender-row-gap: 4px;

  /* ===== 群头衔徽章 ===== */
  --grp-badge-bg-owner: #252525;
  --grp-badge-bg-admin: #505050;
  --grp-badge-bg-lv5: #707070;
  --grp-badge-bg-lv3: #A0A0A0;
  --grp-badge-bg-member: #EAEAEA;
  --grp-badge-color: #FFFFFF;
  --grp-badge-font-size: 9px;
  --grp-badge-height: 15px;
  --grp-badge-padding: 2px 6px;
  --grp-badge-radius: 4px;

  /* ===== 群公告 ===== */
  --grp-ann-bg: #FFFFFF;
  --grp-ann-border: 1px solid #E5E5E5;
  --grp-ann-label-color: #292929;
  --grp-ann-label-size: 11px;
  --grp-ann-text-color: #555555;
  --grp-ann-text-size: 13px;
  --grp-ann-chevron-color: #999999;
  --grp-ann-radius: 12px;
  --grp-ann-padding: 10px 13px;
  --grp-ann-banner-margin: 6px 0 10px;
  --grp-ann-card-radius: 12px;
  --grp-ann-card-padding: 12px 14px;
  --grp-ann-card-margin: 8px 16px;

  /* ===== 群资讯卡 ===== */
  --grp-intro-padding: 32px 16px 24px;
  --grp-intro-name-color: #252525;
  --grp-intro-name-size: 18px;
  --grp-intro-count-color: #999999;
  --grp-intro-count-size: 12px;
  --grp-intro-btn-bg: #292929;
  --grp-intro-btn-color: #FFFFFF;
  --grp-intro-btn-radius: 8px;

  /* ===== 投票、接龙卡片 ===== */
  --grp-card-width: 260px;
  --grp-card-bg: #FFFFFF;
  --grp-card-color: #292929;
  --grp-card-border: 1px solid #E5E5E5;
  --grp-card-radius: 13px;
  --grp-card-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.045);
  --grp-card-head-color: #292929;
  --grp-card-status-bg: #EEEEEE;

  /* 投票 */
  --grp-vote-head-bg: #F0F0F0;
  --grp-vote-accent: #292929;
  --grp-vote-option-bg: #F4F4F4;
  --grp-vote-option-radius: 7px;
  --grp-vote-bar-bg: #EAEAEA;
  --grp-vote-bar-leading-bg: #333333;

  /* 接龙 */
  --grp-chain-head-bg: #F0F0F0;
  --grp-chain-accent: #555555;
  --grp-chain-accent-strong: #252525;
  --grp-chain-join-bg: #292929;
  --grp-chain-join-color: #FFFFFF;

  /* ===== @成员列表 ===== */
  --grp-mention-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.98);
  --grp-mention-radius: 14px;
  --grp-mention-shadow: 0 -3px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  --grp-mention-max-height: 240px;
  --grp-mention-title-bg: #F7F7F7;
  --grp-mention-title-color: #888888;
  --grp-mention-name-color: #292929;
  --grp-mention-hover-bg: #EEEEEE;
  --grp-mention-avatar-radius: 50%;

  /* ===== 加载提示 ===== */
  --grp-load-hint-color: #999999;
}

/* ==========================================
   01. 群聊消息气泡
   只有气泡是直角矩形
   ========================================== */

#chat-message-list-root[data-chat-kind="group"] .bubble-me-custom {
  background: #292A2C !important;
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  padding-top: 7px !important;
  padding-bottom: 7px !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
}

#chat-message-list-root[data-chat-kind="group"] .bubble-them-custom {
  background: #FFFFFF !important;
  color: #292A2C !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  padding-top: 7px !important;
  padding-bottom: 7px !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
}

#chat-message-list-root[data-chat-kind="group"] .bubble-me-custom::before,
#chat-message-list-root[data-chat-kind="group"] .bubble-me-custom::after,
#chat-message-list-root[data-chat-kind="group"] .bubble-them-custom::before,
#chat-message-list-root[data-chat-kind="group"] .bubble-them-custom::after {
  display: none !important;
}

/* ==========================================
   02. 群成员名字与头衔
   ========================================== */

.grp-sender-row {
  gap: 4px !important;
  margin-bottom: 4px !important;
}

.grp-sender-name {
  color: #888888 !important;
  font-size: 11px !important;
  font-weight: 500 !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.2px;
}

.grp-title-badge {
  border-radius: 4px !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08) !important;
}

.grp-title-badge.is-owner {
  background: #252525 !important;
}

.grp-title-badge.is-admin {
  background: #505050 !important;
}

.grp-title-badge.is-lv5 {
  background: #707070 !important;
}

.grp-title-badge.is-lv3 {
  background: #A0A0A0 !important;
}

.grp-title-badge.is-member {
  background: #EAEAEA !important;
}

.grp-title-badge .grp-title-inner {
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
}

.grp-title-badge.is-member .grp-title-inner {
